{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-06097cb2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses reported measurements of f_CP^Htt (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph lists several papers that report results related to CP violation and Higgs interactions, but none of them explicitly mention \"f_CP^Htt\" (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section). Here are the papers and their corresponding results:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of $t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\\\mathrm{jet}}$ and $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\\\mathrm{lep}}$\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2602.18611**: SMEFT individual Wilson coefficient constraints\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state, Resolved Run 3 analysis, Merged Run 3 analysis, and Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b results\n\nSince none of these papers explicitly mention \"f_CP^Htt,\" it appears that the graph does not contain any analyses that reported measurements of this specific observable.\n\nTherefore, the answer is:\n\nThe graph does not record any analyses that reported measurements of \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section).\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The graph does not record any analyses that reported measurements of \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section).\", \"answerable\": false, \"reason\": \"not_in_graph\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2208.12095", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_CP^Htt", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 42, "error": null, "seconds": 0.309}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Htt CP-odd", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.31}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_2"}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:acrel-htjet", "hepkg:result:acrel-htlep", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd