{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-147f96ce", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty from ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 49 analyses that report the systematic uncertainty from ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:719dc1ce88027b51fc140b8c`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:5ee7b252fd18b7e1733f5e78`\n\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:16d45a9f9ad31cc0ce138fdf`\n\n3. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:bb334c6d2a33c3ec9a1d93f1`\n\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:4efbeee916cb051a83e4ae0a`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:c24e1fcf9c7053c880840872`\n\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:2a5f0fc32d91f0239828da7c`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:53f8ee2d3b155c7248ff7690`\n\n6. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `he