{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-16e14c27", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ):\n\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2009.14537**: \"Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2304.08962**: \"Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\"\n- **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n- **2508.13900", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.469}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 62, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepk