{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-29b96704", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Do you know which analyses utilized the Z' -> Hγ signal MC sample (eight mass points, 700-4000 GeV) ?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses utilized the Z' -> Hγ signal MC sample (eight mass points, 700-4000 GeV):\n\n- **2006.05880**: Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\(pp\\) Collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2010.14293**: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collision data with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2102.01444**: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n- **2109.13808**: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling.\n- **2109.13808**: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV).\n- **2112.03161**: Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2307.01094**: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\(W\\) and \\(Z\\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\) and 13 TeV.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\(WW^{\\ast}\\) with the ATLAS detector at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n- **2509.22535**: Simultaneous probe of the charm and bottom quark", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2307.01094", "2402.08486", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Z' -> Hγ", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.286}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2", "hepkg:result:145b646dbebeacbefd96614b", "hepkg:result:8082f0673970bd836137f703", "hepkg:result:faf187c3052688d9764c6e95", "h