{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-2eebb498", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Do you know which analyses in the database list the systematic uncertainty Secondary vertex charge assignment uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses in the database list the systematic uncertainty \"Secondary vertex charge assignment uncertainty\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.07090**: Electron channel (PF-PF) single ratio \\( B(B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ e^+ e^-) / B(B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi(e^+ e^-) K^+) \\)\n- **2401.07090**: Electron channel (PF-LP) single ratio \\( B(B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ e^+ e^-) / B(B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi(e^+ e^-) K^+) \\)\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n\nThese analyses have explicitly listed the systematic uncertainty \"Secondary vertex charge assignment uncertainty\" in their results.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Secondary vertex charge assignment uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.383}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 93, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:electron_single_ratio_pflp", "hepkg:result:electron_single_ratio_pfpf", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:res