{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-311e57f0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses utilized the Prompt diphoton (γγ) background MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.4)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses utilized the Prompt diphoton (γγ) background MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.4):\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2004.04545**: \\( CP \\) Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\( t\\bar{t}H \\) and \\( tH \\) Processes Using \\( H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma \\) with the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H\\to\\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Prompt diphoton (γγ) background MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.4)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.531}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 87, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f38