{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-3218de31", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses in the high-energy-physics paper database employed the SUSY stop-pair signal sample (MadGraph 2.6.2 + Pythia 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses in the high-energy-physics paper database employed the SUSY stop-pair signal sample (MadGraph 2.6.2 + Pythia 8):\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\;$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{{{t}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{t}}}}}}}}{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{b}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS Z+jets differential cross section measurement (jet multiplicity) at 13 TeV\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n\nThese papers are the ones that have used the specified SUSY stop-pair signal sample in their analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "SUSY stop-pair signal sample (MadGraph 2.6.2 + Pythia 8)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.49}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 69, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:zjets_differential_13tev", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:bbh-powheg", "hepkg:sample:diboson-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:dm-signal", "hepkg:sample:ggf-alt-mg5", "hepkg:sample:ggf-powheg-nnlops", "hepkg:sample:ggh-madgraph-nlo", "hepkg:sample:gmsb-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:gmsb_gluino_signal_mc",