{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-3641ef72", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses specify that a region must contain Photon?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses specify that a region must contain a Photon:\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"Lep\" region\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 2-lepton channel eμ top control region (eμ-CR)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2202.08676**: \n  - 4L channel (≥4 light leptons, any number of h candidates)\n  - 3L1T channel (exactly 3 light leptons, ≥1 h candidates)\n  - 3L channel (exactly 3 light leptons, no h candidates)\n  - 2L2T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, ≥2 h candidates)\n  - 2L1T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, exactly 1 h candidate)\n  - 1L3T channel (exactly 1 light lepton, ≥3 h candidates)\n  - 1L2T channel (exactly 1 light lepton, exactly 2 h candidates)\n- **2303.15340**: $e\\mu$ fiducial phase-space region (particle level)\n- **2309.14442**: \n  - 5j3b fiducial phase space (≥5 jets, ≥3 b jets), targeting ttb\n  - 6j4b fiducial phase space (≥6 jets, ≥4 b jets), targeting ttbb\n  - 6j3b3l fiducial phase space (≥6 jets, ≥3 b jets, ≥3 light jets), targeting ttbj\n- **2312.04450**: \n  - 2ℓ-eμ-5j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n  - 2ℓ-eμ-6j1b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n  - 2ℓ-eμ-6j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n- **2401.05299**: 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n- **2503.19420**: \n  - 3-lepton final state (WH, all bosons leptonic)\n  - 4-lepton final state (ZH, all bosons leptonic)\n- **2508.13900**: \n  - 1L, 0 S-jet category\n  - 2L, 0 S-jet category\n\nThese analyses specify that a region must contain a Photon, based on the regions and channels they define.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Photon", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.254}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 215, "error": null, "seconds": 0.059}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:lep", "hepkg:region:emu_fiducial_particle", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1l-0j", "hepkg:channel:1l2t", "hepkg:channel:1l3t", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2l-0j", "hepkg:channel:2l1t", "hepkg:channel:2l2t", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-5j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j1b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j2b", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:channel:3l", "hepkg:region:3l-0j", "hepkg:channel:3l1t", "hepkg:channel:4l", "hepkg:region:ttb_5j3b", "hepkg:region:ttbj_6j3b3l", "hepkg:region:ttbb_6j4b"]}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:diphoton-system", "hepkg:object:diphoton_system", "hepkg:object:displaced-electron", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:electron-candidate", "hepkg:object:electron-high-purity", "hepkg:object:electron-reco", "hepkg:object:e