{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-39fd5f44", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report a measurement of the Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 25 distinct analyses that report a measurement of the Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot) or related observables.\n\nTo provide more context, here are some of the specific observables that were measured:\n\n- **Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot)**\n- **Higgs boson fiducial production cross section, p_T^H > 450 GeV, |y_H| < 2**\n- **Total \\(\\sigma_{WH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section**\n- **Total \\(\\sigma_{ZH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section**\n- **Total \\(\\sigma_{VH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section**\n- **Fiducial inclusive cross section \\(\\sigma(W+c)\\), particle level**\n- **Fiducial inclusive cross section \\(\\sigma(W+c)\\), parton level**\n- **Inclusive \\(t\\bar{t}W\\) production cross-section**\n- **Inclusive \\(\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{-})\\) cross-section**\n- **Inclusive \\(\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{+})\\) cross-section**\n\nThese measurements are spread across 75 distinct facts and 83 assertions in the graph.\n\nIf you need more detailed information on any specific observable or analysis, please let me know.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args"