{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-3f10ef99", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses include the systematic uncertainty report for PDF and strong coupling alpha_S uncertainty in kinematic acceptance?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 50 distinct analyses that include the systematic uncertainty report for PDF and strong coupling alpha_S uncertainty in kinematic acceptance. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450`)\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437`)\n3. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8`)\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`)\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b`)\n6. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe`)\n7. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f`)\n8. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad`)\n9. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19`)\n10. **Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:wz-fiducial-xsec`)\n11. **General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576`)\n12. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "PDF and strong coupling alpha_S uncertainty in kinematic acceptance", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.465}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.053}, {"round":