{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-4227b46b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use the Data-driven misidentification/prompt-rate (fake rate) method to estimate a background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses use the Data-driven misidentification/prompt-rate (fake rate) method to estimate a background:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates backgrounds including $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $t\\bar{t}+Z$.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates the Z+jets background (Z→νν).\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$ (semileptonic/dileptonic), $t\\bar{t}+Z(\\to\\nu\\nu)$, and Z+jets.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}Z$, $Wt$, and \"Others\" minor background category ($VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $t\\bar{t}WZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $tZ$).\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample and estimates backgrounds including SM WZ (three real prompt leptons), $t\\bar{t}$, and Z+jets (FNP-lepton).\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates the Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets background (primarily Z→ττ) and non-resonant WW diboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates the WZ irreducible background.\n- **2205.05120**: Estimates the background from jets misidentified as τ_h candidates (QCD multijet, W+jets, ttbar, diboson).\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates the $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$ and Z+jets.\n- **2303.15340**: Estimates the $Z(→ττ)+jets$ background.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates the top quark-antiquark ($t\\bar{t}$) background.\n\nThese analyses use the Data-driven misidentification/prompt-rate (fake rate) method to estimate various backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928",