{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-4286cc11", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many analyses define the region 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 26 distinct analyses that define the region \"12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\" or similar regions.\n\nTo provide more context, here are some of the specific regions that were found:\n\n- **12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)**\n- **Signal region (VBF jet pair + p_T^miss, lepton/photon/tau_h/b-jet veto), with MTR and VTR category-specific selections**\n- **Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)**\n- **Signal region enriched in ttH(H->cc), D_ttX>0.85**\n- **Signal region enriched in ttZ(Z->cc), D_ttX>0.85**\n- **Signal region enriched in ttH(H->bb), D_ttX>0.85**\n- **Signal region enriched in ttZ(Z->bb), D_ttX>0.85**\n- **≥2 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)**\n- **N_QCD^Non-Iso region**\n- **Generic emerging-jet signal region (>=2 tagged EJs)**\n- **ttbar Validation Region (eμ, ≥1 b-tagged jet, DNN>0.6)**\n- **0 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)**\n- **1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)**\n- **ggH DF 0-jet signal region**\n- **Detector-level extra-jet definition region for N_jet measurement**\n- **W -> l nu multijet background 'fit region' (relaxed E_T^miss and m_T, inverted isolation)**\n- **Off-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^offWZ)**\n- **ll+p proton-tagged signal region (kinematic matching |xi_AFP-xi_ll|<0.005, xi in [0.02,0.12])**\n- **Wh selection signal regions, DFOS subset (SR^Wh_DFOS)**\n- **ggH DF 2-jet signal region**\n- **SR-$\\mu\\mu$ signal region**\n- **ggH DF 1-jet signal region**\n- **Same-sign different-flavour signal region**\n- **gg→H, p_T^H≥450 GeV**\n- **Signal region, non-VBF category, ltau_lprime channel (Symmetry method)**\n\nThese regions are defined across 26 distinct analyses.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.539}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:3lF_sr", "hepkg:region:4lHIJK_sr", "hepkg:region:SRS", "hepkg:region:SR_b", "hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hcc", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:detector_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:fundamental-ltmet-table", "hepkg:region:ggH-0j-pt-ge10", "hepkg:region:ggH-0j-pt-lt10", "hepkg:region:ggH-1j-pt-lt60", "hepkg:region:ggH-2j-mjjge350-ptlt200", "hepkg:region:ggH-2j-mjjlt350-pt120-200", "hepkg:region:ggH-2j-mjjlt350-ptlt120", "hepkg:region:ggH-pt200-300", "hepkg:region:ggH-pt300-450", "hepkg:region:ggH-ptge450", "hepkg:region:ggh-df-0j-sr", "hepkg:region:ggh-df-1j-sr", "hepkg:region:ggh-df-2j-sr", "hepkg:region:ggh_categories", "hepkg:region:hh_bbtautau_hadhad_sr", "hepkg:region:jet-to-tauh-sideband-region", "hepkg:region:particle_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:qcd_nonisolated", "hepkg:region:qqHqq-2j-ge1000-ptge200", "hepkg:region: