{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-43116135", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the H→4l fiducial phase space (particle level):\n\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese analyses define various regions and categories relevant to the H→4l final state, including signal and validation regions, control regions for background estimation, and categories for different production modes.\n\nAnswered based on the graph content.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define the H→4l fiducial phase space (particle level):\\n\\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\\\).\\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\\\).\\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\\\).\\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\\\).\\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "H->4l", "kind": "channel"}, "rows": 42, "error": null, "seconds": 0.314}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_final_state", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "seconds": 0.016}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243d