{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-523466f5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses in the high-energy-physics paper database use the Data-driven matrix method to estimate a background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses in the high-energy-physics paper database use the Data-driven matrix method to estimate a background:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates backgrounds including $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $t\\bar{t}+Z$.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates the Z+jets background (Z→νν).\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$ (semileptonic/dileptonic), $t\\bar{t}+Z(\\to\\nu\\nu)$, and Z+jets.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}Z$, $Wt$, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, and \"Others\" minor background category ($VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $t\\bar{t}WZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $tZ$).\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample and estimates backgrounds including SM WZ (three real prompt leptons), $t\\bar{t}$, and $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ (FNP-lepton).\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates backgrounds including Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets (primarily Z→tautau) and non-resonant WW diboson.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates the WZ irreducible background.\n- **2205.05120**: Estimates the background from jets misidentified as tau_h candidates (QCD multijet, W+jets, ttbar, diboson).\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates the $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$ and Z+jets.\n- **2303.15340**: Estimates the $Z(→\\tau\\tau)+\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates the top quark-antiquark (ttbar) background.\n\nThese analyses use the Data-driven matrix method to estimate various backgrounds.", "answered": true