{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-5acc3dfb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar:\n\n1. **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n2. **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n3. **2109.13808**: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling.\n4. **2109.13808**: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV).\n5. **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n6. **2112.03161**: Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n7. **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n8. **2209.07327**: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n9. **2211.08028**: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\( b \\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n10. **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics including searches for new particles, measurements of production cross sections, and studies of Higgs boson properties. Each of these analyses estimates the Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.354}, {"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Z+jets", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "seconds": 0.293}, {"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttbar", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 34, "error": null, "seconds": 0.354}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_ids": ["hepkg:background:nonprompt-lepton"]}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.023}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_ids": ["hepkg:sample:z_plus_jets"]}, "rows": 2,