{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-5d0a25e1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses in the database used the generator SMEFTatNLO?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses in the database used the generator SMEFTatNLO:\n\n- **2004.04545**: Used the $t\\bar{t}\\gamma\\gamma$ simulated background sample.\n- **2004.14060**: Used the Diboson background MC sample.\n- **2102.01444**: Used the Dark-matter mediator signal samples, $t\\bar{t}+V$ MC sample, $t\\bar{t}WW$ MC sample, $t\\bar{t}WZ$ MC sample, and $tZ,t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t},t\\bar{t}t$ combined MC sample.\n- **2103.04956**: Used the $t\\bar{t}V$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.4.2 LO background MC sample.\n- **2106.01676**: Used the Diboson MC sample, Z+jets MC sample, and ttbar MC sample.\n- **2106.14246**: Used the Chargino-neutralino electroweak SUSY signal MC samples.\n- **2109.13808**: Used the ttbar pair-production sample.\n- **2112.03161**: Used the $t\\bar{t}V$ (ttW, ttZ) MC sample and ttbar production MC sample.\n- **2205.05120**: Used the Diboson production sample generated with MadGraph5_aMC@NLO at NLO.\n- **2208.12095**: Used the $t\\bar{t}V$ MC sample and $tWZ$ and $tZ$ MC sample.\n- **2209.07327**: Used the ttbar production sample and ttW production sample.\n- **2211.08028**: Used the ttbar background MC sample and Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background MC sample.\n- **2402.08486**: Used the Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background sample.\n- **2407.10549**: Used the Alternative $V\\!+\\!\\mathrm{jets}$ sample.\n- **2503.19420**: Used the $q\\bar{q}\\to WH$ simulated sample.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the generator SMEFTatNLO.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.138