{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-627865c5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses have reported measurements of the Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier (μ = σ×B(H→γγ) / (σ×B)_SM)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses have reported measurements of the Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier (μ = σ×B(H→γγ) / (σ×B)_SM):\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of $\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{+})$ and $\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{-})$\n- **2504.13081**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays\" and \"Coupling modifier ratio fit\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result\" and \"Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of measurements related to the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "24