{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-74fd3755", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the  Charge-flip electron background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the charge-flip electron background:\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\\\rightarrow\\\\gamma\\\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n3. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n4. **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n5. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n6. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n7. **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n8. **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\"\n\nThese are the distinct papers that estimate the charge-flip electron background according to the graph.", "answered": true, "p