{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-7c0d1c43", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses require a region defined by Particle-level b-jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses require a region defined by Particle-level b-jet:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS.\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2112.00895**: Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( {{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( {\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and 13 TeV.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2103.04956", "2106.14246", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Particle-level b-jet", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 46, "error": null, "seconds": 0.315}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 43, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e5369