{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-7f0ed613", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses have measured the f_a3^ggH effective CP-odd Hgg cross section fraction?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following papers have measured observables related to the CP-odd Hgg cross section:\n\n1. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n2. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n3. **2401.05299**: Fiducial \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section measurement result, \\( \\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{+}) \\) measurement result, and \\( \\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{-}) \\) measurement result.\n4. **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n5. **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV.\n6. **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n\nThese papers cover various aspects of CP-odd Hgg cross sections and related observables.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following papers have measured observables related to the CP-odd Hgg cross section:\\n\\n1. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\\n2. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\\\bar{t}Z \\\\) production in \\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\\n3. **2401.05299**: Fiducial \\( t\\\\bar{t}W \\\\) cross-section measurement result, \\( \\\\sigma(t\\\\bar{t}W^{+}) \\\\) measurement result, and \\( \\\\sigma(t\\\\bar{t}W^{-}) \\\\) measurement result.\\n4. **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV.\\n5. **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\\\) and \\( Z \\\\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\\\) and 13 TeV.\\n6. **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_a3^ggH effective CP-odd Hgg cross section fraction", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.434}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "CP-odd Hgg cross section", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.401}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_2"}, "rows": 6