{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-8ba7130c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty for PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 47 analyses that report the systematic uncertainty for PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas). Here are some of the specific analyses and the relevant systematic uncertainties they report:\n\n1. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n2. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n4. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the \\( H \\rightarrow WW \\rightarrow l\\nu l\\nu \\) final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n5. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n6. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n7. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n8. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n9. **Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)**:\n   - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n10. **General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)**:\n    - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n11. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state**:\n    - Systematic uncertainties: PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n\n12. **Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.1356