{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-8ed1bced", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Have you checked which analyses utilized the Single top t-channel sample (powheg v2 + MadSpin)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses have utilized the Single top t-channel sample (powheg v2 + MadSpin):\n\n1. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n2. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n3. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n4. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n5. **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}\\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV\n6. **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV\n7. **2405.18661**: CMS \\(t\\bar{t}\\) inclusive cross section measurement in the e-mu final state at 13 TeV\n8. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV\n9. **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\(b\\) final state\n\nThese analyses are documented in the graph and cover a range of topics including Higgs boson decays, top quark production, and searches for supersymmetric particles.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "