{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-957e0873", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses require a region defined by b jet, particle level (matched to b hadron)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses require a region defined by b jet, particle level (matched to b hadron):\n\n1. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n2. **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment.\n3. **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n4. **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n5. **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n6. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n7. **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n8. **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV.\n9. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n\nThese analyses define regions that include b jets at the particle level, matched to b hadrons.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2112.00895", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "b jet, particle level (matched to b hadron)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 54, "error": null, "seconds": 0.358}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:CR_b_ee", "hepkg:region:SR_b", "hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b", "hepkg:region:baseline", "hepkg:region:baseline-we", "hepkg:region:baseline-wmu", "hepkg:region:detector_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:emu_fiducial_particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-3l-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-4l-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial_particle_level", "hepkg:region:fiducial_phase_space", "hepkg:region:ggH-0j-pt-ge10", "hepkg:region:ggH-0j-pt-lt10", "hepkg:region:ggH-1j-pt-120-200", "hepkg:region:ggH-1j-pt-60-120", "hepkg: