{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-9dfee04c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses did you find that used the sample V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\":\n\n1. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n2. **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n3. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n4. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n6. **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n7. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n8. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n9. **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n10. **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.487}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 76, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:diboson-sherpa", "hepkg:sample:diboson_sherpa", "hepkg:sample:ew_zjj_herwig_sample", "hepkg:sample:ewk-vvjj-sherpa", "hepkg:sample:gammajets_vbf_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:gg_vv_nominal", "hepkg:sample:gg_ww_sherpa_sample", "hepkg:sample:multiboson-sherpa", "hepkg:sample:qcd-multijet", "hepkg:sample:qcd-multijet-sim", "hepkg:sample:qcd_multijet", "hepkg:sample:qcd_multijet_mc", "hepkg:sample:qcd_multijet_mg5amcnlo",