{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-a5c239dc", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses in the database estimate the background for Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 39 distinct analyses that estimate the background for \"Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\\\bar{t}H$, $t\\\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)\" and related backgrounds. Here are some of the specific analyses and the backgrounds they estimate:\n\n1. **CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\\\bar{t}H$, $t\\\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)\".\n\n2. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)\" and \"Other minor SM backgrounds (WZ, ZZ, VVV, tW, WW, SM Higgs)\".\n\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)\" and \"Other minor SM backgrounds (WZ, ZZ, VVV, tW, WW, SM Higgs)\".\n\n4. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)\".\n\n5. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)\" and \"Other minor SM backgrounds (WZ, ZZ, VVV, tW, WW, SM Higgs)\".\n\n6. **HH->bb tautau analysis result**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)\".\n\n7. **HH->multilepton analysis result**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)\".\n\n8. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state**:\n   - Estimates background for \"Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)\".\n\n9. **Inclusive and differential", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Other backgrounds (diboson, tZ, ttH, ttW, tWZ)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.477}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 116, "error": null, "seconds": 0.013}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg: