{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-b5715163", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Can you tell me which analyses define the object Secondary vertex (SV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Secondary vertex (SV)\" or related vertices:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2004.04545**: $CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2012.01581**: Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2109.13808**: Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(\\rightarrow e\\nu\\mu\\nu)jj$ production in $36.1\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2112.00895**: Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=8\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb$^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2403.01556**: Search for dark QCD with emerging jets in proton-proton collisions", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Secondary vertex (SV)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.303}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "seconds": 0.03}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "he