{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-b5fc54b2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Would you know which analyses use the Data-driven jet-smearing (resolution-function) technique for estimating a background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses use the Data-driven jet-smearing (resolution-function) technique for estimating a background:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Uses $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ and $t\\bar{t}$ backgrounds.\n- **2010.14293**: Uses $Z+jets$ background (Z→νν).\n- **2012.03799**: Uses $t\\bar{t}$ (semileptonic/dileptonic) and $Z+jets$ backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Uses $t\\bar{t}$, $Wt$, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, and \"Others\" minor background categories.\n- **2106.01676**: Uses $Z+jets$ MC sample, SM WZ, and $t\\bar{t}$ backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Uses Drell-Yan $Z/\\gamma^{*}+jets$ (primarily $Z\\to\\tau\\tau$) and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Uses WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Uses $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Uses $t\\bar{t}$ and $Z+jets$ backgrounds.\n- **2303.15340**: Uses $Z(\\to\\tau\\tau)+jets$ background.\n- **2308.02285**: Uses top quark-antiquark ($t\\bar{t}$), diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ), and $Z+jets$ (or virtual photon) backgrounds.\n- **2401.05299**: Uses $VV$ (diboson) background.\n- **2503.19420**: Uses $Z/\\gamma^{*}$ (Z+jets) simulated sample.\n\nThese analyses employ various data-driven techniques, including the Data-driven jet-smearing (resolution-function) technique, to estimate the backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", 