{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-c3659ed2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use Direct MC simulation estimate (no control-region normalisation) to estimate a background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses use a direct MC simulation estimate (no control-region normalisation) to estimate a background:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Uses $Z \\to \\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2007.02873**: Uses Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Uses Z+jets (Z→νν) and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Uses $Wt$ single-top, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, and \"Others\" minor backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets, WZ, and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Uses Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2110.11231**: Uses VVV triboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Uses WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Uses $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Uses W+jets and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2307.01094**: Uses $WZ$ + jets background.\n- **2308.02285**: Uses diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) and Z+jets (or virtual photon) backgrounds.\n- **2312.04450**: Uses $Z$+jets background ($Z+b$, $Z+c$, $Z+l$).\n\nThese analyses are supported by the evidence in the graph. \n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses use a direct MC simulation estimate (no control-region normalisation) to estimate a background:\\n\\n- **2004.14060**: Uses $Z \\\\to \\\\nu\\\\bar{\\\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets and $W$+jets backgrounds.\\n- **2007.02873**: Uses Z+jets background.\\n- **2010.14293**: Uses Z+jets (Z→νν) and W+jets backgrounds.\\n- **2102.01444**: Uses $Wt$ single-top, $Z/\\\\gamma^{*}+\\\\mathrm{jets}$, and \\\"Others\\\" m