{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-cc5c63f7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses document the systematic uncertainty for the Colour reconnection model uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses document the systematic uncertainty for the Colour reconnection model uncertainty:\n\n1. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n2. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n3. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n4. **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\n5. **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\n6. **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\n7. **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n8. **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses have documented the systematic uncertainty related to the Colour reconnection model.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.0781