{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-cf4d7b22", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses in the high-energy physics paper database measured Jet multiplicity (N_jets)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 12 distinct analyses that measured jet multiplicity (N_jets) or related observables. Here is a list of the papers and the specific observables they measured:\n\n1. **Paper: 2001.06899**\n   - **Observable:** Cross section ratio \\( R(c/j) = \\sigma(Z+c \\text{ jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\text{jets}) \\)\n   - **Observable:** Cross section ratio \\( R(b/j) = \\sigma(Z+b \\text{ jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\text{jets}) \\)\n   - **Observable:** Cross section ratio \\( R(c/b) = \\sigma(Z+c \\text{ jets})/\\sigma(Z+b \\text{ jets}) \\)\n\n2. **Paper: 2103.04956**\n   - **Observable:** Differential fiducial cross section as a function of number of associated jets \\( N^{\\text{jet}} \\)\n\n3. **Paper: 2110.11231**\n   - **Observable:** Differential WZ cross section vs jet multiplicity\n\n4. **Paper: 2309.14442**\n   - **Observable:** Jet multiplicity \\( N_{\\text{jets}} \\)\n   - **Observable:** b jet multiplicity \\( N_{b} \\)\n   - **Observable:** Scalar \\( p_T \\) sum of all jets \\( H_T^j \\)\n\n5. **Paper: 2312.04450**\n   - **Observable:** Differential \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross section vs \\( N_{\\text{jets}} \\) (3\\(\\ell\\) channel)\n   - **Observable:** Differential \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross section vs \\( N_{\\text{jets}} \\) (4\\(\\ell\\) channel)\n\n6. **Paper: 2401.05299**\n   - **Observable:** Absolute differential \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section vs \\( N_{\\text{jets}} \\)\n   - **Observable:** Normalised differential \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section vs \\( N_{\\text{jets}} \\)\n\n7. **Paper: 2402.08486**\n   - **Observable:** Extra-jet multiplicity \\( N_{\\text{jet}} \\) (jet \\( p_T > 40 \\) 