{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-d9cf5adc", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20):\\n\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2009.14537: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\\n- 2110.11231: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\\\to\\\\gamma\\\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2303.15340: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\;$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2304.08962: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2503.19420: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\\n- 2508.13900: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2510.07527: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002pt", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.373}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 61, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d