{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-f9d7a492", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report measurements for Signal strength mu = (sigma_H/sigma_H^SM) x B(H->inv)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report measurements for the signal strength \\(\\mu = (\\sigma_H/\\sigma_H^{SM}) \\times B(H \\to \\text{inv})\\):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\(t\\bar{t}H\\) and \\(tH\\) Processes Using \\(H \\to \\gamma\\gamma\\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n3. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\to b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2503.19420**: \"Compatibility test of observed \\(\\mu_{WH}\\) and \\(\\mu_{ZH}\\) with each other and with the SM\"\n5. **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)\"\n6. **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result\"\n7. **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result\"\n\nThese papers cover various aspects of Higgs boson interactions and decays, including signal strength measurements.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2401.07090", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal strength mu = (sigma_H/sigma_H^SM) x B(H->inv)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.464}