{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-fd9a6229", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses provide an estimate for the DY+jets background estimate in the SR?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses provide an estimate for the DY+jets background in the signal region (SR):\n\n1. **2004.14060**: \"Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2010.14293**: \"Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2012.03799**: \"Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n5. **2102.01444**: \"Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n6. **2106.01676**: \"Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n7. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n9. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n10. **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV\"\n11. **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n12. **2506.13565**: \"Search for nonresonant new physics signals in high-mass dilepton events produced in association with \\( b \\)-tagged jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n13. **2511.11853**: \"Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two \\( b \\)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "DY+jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.262}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "SR", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.322}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.03}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predi