{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48228", "qid": "gen-rwfaithful-ff9e3b39", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Do you know which analyses quote the systematic uncertainty called L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 40 analyses that quote the systematic uncertainty called \"L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty\" or similar phrasings. Here are some of the specific analyses and the exact phrasing used in each:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:9c4ad1c1c70db6b8ce38a925`\n\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:6064366b8ce244d68e76ee9c`, `hepkg:assertion:4cecba2996e7b0359beb76bf`, `hepkg:assertion:f0bb64dc6dab4fae1c7449b1`, `hepkg:assertion:16d45a9f9ad31cc0ce138fdf`\n\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:4bd912c188fe45c1b50a6116`\n\n4. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:b88854a08aff3ae8fccd61fa`, `hepkg:assertion:d2993ddff9935c81bd3e3c94`, `hepkg:assertion:2a5f0fc32d91f0239828da7c`, `hepkg:assertion:76e8e682243e00104397631f`, `hepkg:assertion:141080bae91125f271817827`\n\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:abe9f42dd09dd2e8295564ac`, `hepkg:assertion:7a6f3b6fb9125c2f6b671523`\n\n6. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:0c805fc676af278f603b5bf9`, `hepkg:assertion:1247f648ac4313196dfe7a24`, `hepkg:assertion:83e802e5382848ad01492151`\n\n7. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons**:\n   - Assertion IDs:", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.14246", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.422}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.054}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 94, "error": null, "seconds": 0.015}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:muon_energy_scale", "hepkg:syst:muon_reco_id_iso", "hepkg:syst:pileup", "hepkg:syst:trigger_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:afp-correction-total-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:b-tagging", "hepkg:systematic:b_jet_msv_shape_correction", "hepkg:systematic:b_tagging", "hepkg:systematic:btag-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:btag_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:btagging", "hepkg:systematic:charge-flip